{"id":"ccac24cdfa254e90","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-gl-normal.md","title":"Normality and Conjunction Distribution for GL","display":"lem-gl-normal — Normality and Conjunction Distribution for GL","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-gl-normal","aliases":["89-lem-gl-normal"],"display":"lem-gl-normal — Normality and Conjunction Distribution for GL","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]","[[89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl]]","[[89-lem-normal-box-lifting]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-gl-normal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-gl-normal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-gl-normal — Normality and Conjunction Distribution for GL"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bdef52f3ff411531\" href=\"?note=bdef52f3ff411531\" title=\"89-df-normal-modal-logic\">89-df-normal-modal-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fae50ce87c0c5e77\" href=\"?note=fae50ce87c0c5e77\" title=\"89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl\">89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7c0e4d58dc068222\" href=\"?note=7c0e4d58dc068222\" title=\"89-lem-normal-box-lifting\">89-lem-normal-box-lifting</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}\\)</span> 为含替换闭包的正规逻辑谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Normal}(\\mathrm{GL})\\land\n(\\Box(A\\land B)\\leftrightarrow(\\Box A\\land\\Box B))\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Normal}(\\mathrm{GL})\\land\n(\\Box(A\\land B)\\leftrightarrow(\\Box A\\land\\Box B))\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 4–7；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>GL 的交集定义包含 K 并对 MP、必然化闭合；替换闭包由 GL 公理模式及有限证明归纳的替换引理给出。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(\\mathrm{GL})\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(\\mathrm{GL})\\)</span> 成立，再实例化有限合取盒提升引理得到原有二元素分配式。原文件标题和说明声称正规性，却只正式断言二元素分配；此处保留原结论并补上可供典范模型使用的实际正规性断言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-normal-modal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bdef52f3ff411531","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl","status":"resolved","id":"fae50ce87c0c5e77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-normal-box-lifting","status":"resolved","id":"7c0e4d58dc068222","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-normal-box-lifting]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Normal}(\\mathrm{GL})\\land\n(\\Box(A\\land B)\\leftrightarrow(\\Box A\\land\\Box B))\\in\\mathrm{GL}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(\\mathrm{GL})","display":false}],"bytes":1272,"backlinks":[{"id":"6f068c38418e21f2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1cd2a39dee160249","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9d2a6862fd2083e6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"426d9ae12ef39fe8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"03089c3cefed4872","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"70714818ed137ea4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"570349aa538831d0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ce272d08b1c31931","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]] → [[89-df-normal-modal-logic]] → [[89-df-gl-logic]] → [[89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl]] → [[89-lem-gl-normal]] → [[89-thm-gl-consistency]]"}],"outgoing":["0006800fa1c85177","bdef52f3ff411531","fae50ce87c0c5e77","7c0e4d58dc068222"]}